-- Q3791: SOC Reporting and Trust Services Criteria [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Ignore the exceptions as the service organization''s sole responsibility","Evaluate the exceptions'' impact on risk and assess compensating controls","Immediately terminate the contract with the cloud service provider","File a formal complaint with the AICPA about the service organization"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AT-C Section 205 and AICPA SOC guidance, user entity management should evaluate the nature and significance of reported exceptions against their own risk profile and control environment. This includes assessing whether complementary user entity controls (CUECs) mitigate the identified risks.
